  "sourceQuote": "직각삼각형 $ABD$에서 $\\angle B = 30^\\circ$, $\\overline{BD} = 12\\text{ cm}$이므로 $$y = \\overline{AD} = \\overline{BD} \\tan 30^\\circ = 12 \\times \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} = 4\\sqrt{3}$$ $$x = \\overline{AB} = \\dfrac{\\overline{BD}}{\\cos 30^\\circ} = \\dfrac{12}{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}} = 8\\sqrt{3}$$ 직각삼각형 $ABC$에서 $$z = \\overline{AC} = \\overline{AB} \\tan 30^\\circ = 8\\sqrt{3} \\times \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} = 8$$ 따라서 $$xy + z = (8\\sqrt{3})(4\\sqrt{3}) + 8 = 96 + 8 = 104$$ 따라서 정답은 ①이다."
